{{ define "title" }}Terms of Service{{ end }}

{{ define "main" }}
<main class="w-full bg-slate-50" data-page="terms">
  <header class="bg-slate-900">
    <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-screen-xl px-3 py-10 md:px-6 md:py-12">
      <p class="mb-3 text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-orange-500">Legal</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-white sm:text-5xl">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-300">Last updated: November 17, 2026</p>
      <p class="mt-5 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-7 text-slate-100">These terms describe the rules for using theSketchDB, a website for discovering and organizing sketch comedy.</p>
    </div>
  </header>
  <article class="mx-auto w-full max-w-screen-xl px-3 py-8 md:px-6 md:py-12">
    <div class="max-w-3xl space-y-9 text-base leading-7 text-slate-700">
      <section><h2 class="mb-3 text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900">1. Using the service</h2><p>You may browse theSketchDB and use its features for lawful, personal purposes. By using the service, you agree to these terms. If you do not agree, please stop using the service.</p></section>
      <section><h2 class="mb-3 text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900">2. Accounts</h2><p>You are responsible for maintaining the security of your account and for activity performed through it. Please provide accurate account information and notify us if you suspect unauthorized access.</p></section>
      <section><h2 class="mb-3 text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900">3. Acceptable use</h2><p>Do not use the service to violate laws, harass others, impersonate people, distribute malicious software, interfere with the site's operation, or attempt unauthorized access to accounts or systems. We may restrict access when necessary to protect the service or its users.</p></section>
      <section><h2 class="mb-3 text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900">4. Sketches and third-party content</h2><p>theSketchDB catalogs information about sketch comedy. Sketches, videos, images, trademarks, and other third-party materials belong to their respective owners. Links or embedded content may lead to third-party services governed by their own terms and policies. Inclusion in the catalog does not imply endorsement or ownership.</p></section>
      <section><h2 class="mb-3 text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900">5. Your contributions</h2><p>If you submit ratings, favorites, lists, or other content, you remain responsible for what you submit. You grant us permission to store, display, and process that content as needed to operate the service, consistent with your applicable visibility settings.</p></section>
      <section><h2 class="mb-3 text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900">6. Availability and accuracy</h2><p>We aim to keep catalog information useful and accurate, but we cannot guarantee that all information is complete, current, or error-free. Features may change or become unavailable without notice.</p></section>
      <section><h2 class="mb-3 text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900">7. Disclaimer and liability</h2><p>The service is provided on an “as is” and “as available” basis, to the extent permitted by applicable law. We make no guarantees of uninterrupted availability. To the extent permitted by law, we are not liable for indirect or consequential losses arising from use of the service. Nothing in these terms limits rights that cannot legally be excluded.</p></section>
      <section><h2 class="mb-3 text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900">8. Suspension and termination</h2><p>You may stop using the service at any time. We may suspend or terminate access if an account violates these terms or threatens the service's security or operation.</p></section>
      <section><h2 class="mb-3 text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900">9. Changes to these terms</h2><p>We may revise these terms as the service evolves. Updated terms will be posted on this page with a revised date. Continued use after changes take effect constitutes acceptance where permitted by law.</p></section>
      <section><h2 class="mb-3 text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900">10. Contact</h2><p>For questions about these terms, email <a class="font-medium text-orange-700 underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-orange-600" href="mailto:support@thesketchdb.com">support@thesketchdb.com</a>.</p></section>
    </div>
    <footer class="mt-10 max-w-3xl border-t border-slate-200 pt-6 text-sm"><a href="/privacy" class="font-bold text-orange-700 hover:text-orange-600">Read our Privacy Policy &rarr;</a></footer>
  </article>
</main>
{{ end }}
